<title>USA: USAir marketing executive to retire.</title>
<headline>USAir marketing executive to retire.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USAir Group Inc said W.T. Lagow, its executive vice president of marketing, will retire January 31 after 30 years in the airline industry.</p>
<p>Lagow joined USAir in 1992, after previously serving as a planning executive at UAL Corp's United Airlines.</p>
<p>Lagow did not return calls seeking comment on his future plans.</p>
